Package: bialet
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: full-stack web framework with embedded Wren and SQLite
 Bialet combines the Wren scripting language, an HTTP server, and a
 SQLite database in a single binary. Routes follow the filesystem, with
 each .wren file acting as a handler that returns a response body. There
 is no separate runtime, package manifest, or build step.
 .
 This package links dynamically against the distribution's SQLite,
 libcurl, and OpenSSL. The self-contained static binary is published in
 the GitHub release archives instead.
